red the favorites, with Setiawan having been Olympic champion with a different partner in 2008. Top seeded going into the 2020 tournament were reigning Asian champions " [:a {:href "/athletes/143714"} "Marcus Gideon"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/143713"} "Kevin Sukamuljo"] ", also of Indonesia."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The tournament went as expected in the group stages, but a shock came in the quarterfinals, when Gideon and Sukamuljo were soundly defeated by the duo from Malaysia of " [:a {:href "/athletes/145202"} "Aaron Chia"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/145204"} "Soh Wooi Yik"] ". This was followed by another surprise in the finals when the other Indonesian team was vanquished even more thoroughly by " [:a {:href "/athletes/146852"} "Lee Yang"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/146853"} "Wang Chi-Lin"] " of Taiwan. Lee and Wang went on to face China’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/141822"} "Li Junhui"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/141823"} "Liu Yuchen"] " in the final, the latter of whom had emerged victorious over the Malaysian pair. Once again, however, the Taiwanese duo had control of the match and took the gold medal with relative ease, becoming the first Taiwanese Olympic medallists in badminton (" [:a {:href "/athletes/125109"} "Tai Tzu-ying"] " would take silver in the women’s singles the following day). The bronze medal match was a little harder fought, but the Malaysians came out on top, having prevented both of the favored Indonesian teams from reaching the podium."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/146852"} "Lee Yang"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/146853"} "Wang Chi-Lin"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/TPE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/TPE.png"}] "TPE"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/141822"} "Li Junhui"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/141823"} "Liu Yuchen"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/145202"} "Aaron Chia"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/145204"} "Soh Wooi Yik"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/MAS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/MAS.png"}] "MAS"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/124951"} "Mohammad Ahsan"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/112858"} "Hendra Setiawan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/INA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/INA.png"}] "INA"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/142160"} "Kim Astrup"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/142159"} "Anders Skaarup Rasmussen"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/DEN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/DEN.png"}] "DEN"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/134729"} "Hiroyuki Endo"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/144559"} "Yuta Watanabe"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JPN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JPN.png"}] "JPN"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/143714"} "Marcus Fernaldi Gideon"] " / " [:a {:href 